<title>CANADA: Algoma Steel to sell 6 mln shares at C$8.75.</title>
<headline>Algoma Steel to sell 6 mln shares at C$8.75.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algoma Steel Inc entered into an agreement where a syndicate of underwriters would buy and sell to the public six million Algoma Steel common shares at C$8.75 each, lead underwriter Nesbitt Burns said on Monday.</p>
<p>The underwriters have the option to buy up to an additional 1.5 million common shares, Nesbitt Burns said.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close by about February 18, 1997.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
